        "quote": "(a) The City Engineer is authorized to prepare standard plans and specifications for the construction of all improvements as well as any other work within the City’s rights-of-way which shall be furnished to any permittee upon application. It shall be the duty of the City Engineer to superintend and inspect all work authorized by a permit. All completed work shall be inspected by the City Engineer and must pass a final inspection.",
